gressive version of the Monroe Doctrine</a><span>, the 1823 claim of U.S. p=
rimacy in Latin America. And its pairing with the right=E2=80=99s ascendanc=
e has set up a potentially fundamental shift.</span></p><p style=3D"font:no=
rmal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Many of the =
right-wing governments that took power in the last year won on promises to =
hit cartels harder, and the Trump administration is eager to help.</span></=
p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15p=
x"><span>In effect, these governments are betting that cooperating with the=
